dium weight, at the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` tier. `size` and `emphasis` work as on `Text`."},"776":{"id":"/docs/components/label-9","page_id":"/docs/components/label","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/label#features","content":"Field CSS adds the required asterisk when the field root is `isRequired`. That is not a Label prop."},"777":{"id":"/docs/components/label-10","page_id":"/docs/components/label","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/label#default","content":"Label names a field. The required asterisk comes from Field CSS when the root is `isRequired`."},"778":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"page","content":"ListBox","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox"},"779":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-0","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox","content":"ListBox is a selectable collection of items rendered inline. Use it for non-popover pickers, inline lists, or as a building block for higher-level components like Select."},"780":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-1","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#features","content":"Features"},"781":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-2","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#installation","content":"Installation"},"782":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-3","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#examples","content":"Examples"},"783":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-4","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#default","content":"Default"},"784":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-5","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/listbox#list-box-controlled","content":"List Box Controlled"},"785":{"id":"/docs/compo