t-side hydration"],[1457,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[951,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[1884,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[1873,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[629,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[673,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[1710,"**Tab**"],[244,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1134,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1321,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1607,"**The body is `<Text slot=\"body\">`**, once or as many times as the copy needs."],[1605,"**The eyebrow is `slot=\"eyebrow\"`**, on either a `Text` or a `Tag`. The two forms swap\nfreely, and a `Tag` is sized to pair with the lockup."],[1606,"**The title is `<Heading slot=\"title\">`.** Pick the level from the document outline, not the\nvisual size: `size` handles the visuals, so `level={1}` in an `xs` lockup is perfectly valid."],[1089,"**Titles overflow:** that's expected — titles truncate. Shorten the title."],[1706,"**ToggleButton Item:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[1705,"**ToggleButtonGroup Container:** `data-size`"],[1888,"**Tooltips** use absolute positioning and scroll-aware calculations for accurate placement"],[1877,"**Tooltips**: Show on both hover and focus for keyboard users"],[688,"**Trade-offs:**"],[630,"**Transform**: `rotate`, `flip` for icon transformations"],[870,"**Trigger and calendar**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a calendar icon and the formatted value from the field. `DatePickerCalendar` (and `DateRangePickerCalendar`) is the calendar in the popover it opens: it takes `Calendar` props plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `Calendar` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[1271,"**Trigger and options**: An empty `Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders the selected value and a chevron from the field. `SelectOptions` is the list in the popover the Select opens: it takes `ListBox` props (including `items` with a render function for a dynamic collection) plus `popoverProps` for the overlay. Write `Popover`, `Content`, and `ListBox` yourself to replace the whole overlay"],[840,"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"],[2064,"**Typed Refs:** Refs are correctly typed based on the `as` value - `useRef<HTMLButtonElement>` works with `as=\"button\"`."],[624,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[1851,"**TypeScript support**: Fully typed with comprehensive prop interfaces"],[2128,"**Use `Grid` when**: You need explicit two-dimensional layouts with rows and columns, named grid areas, or responsive auto-fill patterns."],[691,"**Use default mode** for SSR applications or when icons appear infrequently"],[692,"**Use sprite mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[702,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[955,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1275,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1641,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[953,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1906,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1843,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1882,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1852,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[678,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1413,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1410,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1419,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1420,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1408,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1414,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1417,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1411,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1423,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[110,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[2107,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2109,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2103,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[2105,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[2110,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[2106,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[2104,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[2108,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[2060,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[560,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a best-effort filter for the OS picker — always validate file type and size again in your `onSelect` handler, since it can be bypassed."],[1600,"`align` centers the parts as well as the text, so a `Tag` eyebrow stays centered too."],[1140,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[1326,"`aria-checked` indicates selection state"],[354,"`aria-describedby` wires the `helperText` to the progressbar for screen readers"],[247,"`aria-disabled` for disabled checkboxes"],[1141,"`aria-disabled` for disabled options"],[1327,"`aria-disabled` for disabled segments"],[249,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1143,"`aria-invalid` for validation errors"],[1722,"`aria-label` (or `aria-labelledby`) is required on the group container"],[1328,"`aria-label` required on the container for screen readers"],[353,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[1041,"`aria-labelledby` associates the visible label when the `label` prop is provided"],[248,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[1142,"`aria-required` when selection is required"],[351,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[1039,"`aria-valuemin` and `aria-valuemax` define the range (default `0`–`100`)"],[1038,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value"],[350,"`aria-valuenow` is omitted while indeterminate; otherwise it reflects the current value (clamped to 0–100)"],[1040,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`)"],[352,"`aria-valuetext` and visible value text are omitted while indeterminate; otherwise `aria-valuetext` provides a formatted string (e.g. `\"60%\"`) via `Intl.NumberFormat`; the same string is rendered inside the circle. Override the text with the `aria-valuetext` prop, or control formatting with `formatOptions`"],[2052,"`Box` is a polymorphic layout component that renders as any HTML element or custom component via the `as` prop. It provides consistent spacing, elevation, rounding, and self-alignment within flex or grid containers."],[448,"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."],[109,"`Calendar` values are `CalendarDate` objects. Import the date primitives you need from the `@godaddy/antares/date` subpath:"],[1863,"`categoryColors` maps individual category values to palette color indices, overriding\nthe series color for just those bars — so a single series can carry a different color\nper category. All three periods here share the same category-to-color map, so each\nchannel keeps one color across every period; the comparison periods are dropped to\nreduced opacity."],[233,"`CheckboxGroup` is composed: write `Label`, a `Group` holding the `Checkbox` items, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. The `Group` takes its axis, gap, and presentational role from the group's `orientation`, so a bare `<Group>` is all you need; pass your own `direction`/`gap` to lay the items out differently. Each `Checkbox` takes label text next to the indicator."],[303,"`ChipButton` for menu filters and other actions with a Chip-like appearance"],[321,"`ChipButton` is a real button and exposes menu state through `MenuTrigger`; provide an accessible name when the visible content is incomplete."],[299,"`ChipGroup` + `ChipList` + `Chip` for grouped values, selection, keyboard navigation, and removal"],[314,"`ChipGroup` owns selection and removal behavior. Use a Chip render prop for\nstate-dependent content, and `Button` with `slot=\"remove\"` together with\n`onRemove` for removable items. See **Toggle Chips** and **Removable Chips**."],[1764,"`className` and `style` apply to the tooltip panel."],[439,"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."],[449,"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."],[450,"`CollapsiblePanel` uses `role=\"group\"` by default. Keep it when the panel's content does not need\na navigation landmark; there is no need to set it explicitly."],[441,"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."],[2020,"`colorIndex` pins each series to a palette color. Any series can use any index,\nindependently — here two pairs each share an index so an actual line and its\ndashed forecast read as the same color, distinguished only by line style."],[1075,"`currentStep` is the single source of truth for the timeline. Omit it for a not-yet-started flow where every step is `future`; pass the step count for a fully completed flow where every step is `past`."],[653,"`data-color`: Applied when color prop is set"],[656,"`data-flip`: Applied when flip prop is set (\"horizontal\" or \"vertical\")"],[652,"`data-icon`: The icon name (always present)"],[654,"`data-loading`: Applied during icon loading from CDN"],[655,"`data-mode`: Applied when mode prop is set (e.g., \"sprite\")"],[657,"`data-rotate`: Applied when rotate prop is set (90, 180, or 270)"],[1401,"`data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`, `data-readonly`, `data-invalid`, `data-required`, `data-size`"],[872,"`DatePicker` (single) and `DateRangePicker` (range): a read-only formatted date label; the whole field opens a calendar popover"],[1534,"`Detail` is supporting copy, such as captions and metadata, on the detail ramp. It keeps the\nsurrounding color; add `emphasis=\"passive\"` to mute it."],[480,"`DrawerTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Drawer>`, handling open\nstate automatically."],[574,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1525,"`emphasis` picks a feedback color and changes only the color."],[1533,"`emphasis` selects a feedback color and changes nothing else. Without it, text inherits the\nsurrounding color."],[985,"`Enter/Space`"],[393,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[446,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[522,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[747,"`Enter` / `Space`"],[489,"`Escape`"],[987,"`Escape`"],[1769,"`Escape`"],[1804,"`Escape`"],[559,"`FileTrigger` adds no visuals or ARIA of its own — accessibility comes from the pressable child you provide. Use a component with an accessible name (e.g. an Antares `Button` with clear label text) so assistive technology announces the action. The underlying `<input>` is visually hidden but remains operable by keyboard through the child's press behavior."],[2089,"`Flex` is a one-dimensional layout component for arranging children in rows or columns with alignment and spacing control. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[661,"`focusable=\"false\"`: Prevents keyboard focus"],[2127,"`Grid` is a two-dimensional CSS Grid layout component for complex grid-based layouts. It extends `Box`, inheriting all `Box` capabilities (padding, elevation, rounding, self-alignment, and polymorphic `as` prop)."],[576,"`Heading` renders a semantic `h1`-`h6` element via the `level` prop.\nInside a `Modal`/`Dialog`, add `slot=\"title\"` and it labels the dialog automatically."],[453,"`Icon slot=\"indicator\"` is decorative and receives `aria-hidden=\"true\"` automatically."],[735,"`InlineDrawerPanel` is the collapsible content for the accordion pattern — a thin wrapper over RAC `DisclosurePanel` that hides when collapsed. The trigger is any component you slot in with `slot=\"trigger\"` — there's no dedicated trigger component."],[764,"`Input` is the single-line control inside a field, not a field on its own. Prefer `TextField` or `NumberField` as the parent; see those components for fuller examples."],[2003,"`legendPosition` puts the legend above or below the plot, or hides it with `null`. Multi-series charts get a bottom legend by default."],[577,"`level` sets the semantics and `size` sets the look, so the two never have to match. Without\n`size`, a heading takes the size scope's heading tier at any level."],[2058,"`lg` - Large spacing"],[794,"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."],[2057,"`md` - Medium spacing"],[829,"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."],[107,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[875,"`minValue` / `maxValue` bounds and `isDateUnavailable` per-day disabling"],[1797,"`Modal` accepts `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` directly, so it can be controlled without a\n`ModalTrigger`. Useful when the modal is opened from several places at